/*  Install Allure Report 

1. To install the Allure    - npm install -g allure-commandline
2. To Execute superate test - &particularTest& --reporter=line,allure-playwright
3. To Generate the Report   - allure generate ./allure-results --clean -o ./allure-report
3.  To open the allure       - allure open ./allure-report

*/




